# Rank 1028 / CVE-2022-30953 (SECURITY-2502): Blue Ocean's SCM endpoints let an
# attacker make Jenkins connect to a server of their choosing. getState() on the
# Github, Bitbucket and Git SCM classes validated a caller-supplied endpoint and
# reached out to it with no permission check, and the enclosing resource was
# annotated @PUT rather than @POST. The fixed revision adds a shared
# checkPermission() on AbstractScm requiring Item.CREATE on the root org folder,
# calls it from each getState(), and changes the verb to @POST.
#
# ATTENTION, precision cost, and the third measurement of the same shape in this
# batch. Nothing focused fires either side: the vulnerable and fixed revisions of
# GithubScm.java both report the same four rows, one VYQL-DESER-001 and three
# VYQL-INJ-004, none of which concern the missing permission check.
#
# The two rules this CVE invites are the ones measured and rejected here.
# Requiring a permission check on REST endpoints: the plugin has 46 endpoint
# methods in its main sources while only 16 files call hasPermission or
# checkPermission at all, and the fixed revision carries three such endpoints,
# so the rule reports
# on the order of thirty sites for three true positives. Requiring a particular
# HTTP verb annotation: rank 1027 measured that on another Jenkins plugin, where
# 19 form methods carry one annotation between them.
# Rank 1011 measured the authorization variant on a Go service at 4.1 per cent
# package-scoped and 19.5 per cent file-scoped. Three independent codebases, the
# same answer: endpoints legitimately differ in whether they need a guard, and
# the structure does not say which.
#
# verify_current_expected: attention-precision-cost

test "rank1028: SCM state endpoint validates a caller endpoint with no permission check"
  lang java
  file blueocean-github-pipeline/src/main/java/io/jenkins/blueocean/blueocean_github_pipeline/GithubScm.java
  reject VYQL-AUTH-073
  code
  ```
  public class GithubScm extends AbstractScm {
      @Override
      public Object getState() {
          this.validateExistingAccessToken();
          return super.getState();
      }
  }
  ```

test "rank1028: fix requires Item.CREATE before returning the state"
  lang java
  file blueocean-github-pipeline/src/main/java/io/jenkins/blueocean/blueocean_github_pipeline/GithubScm.java
  reject VYQL-AUTH-073
  code
  ```
  public class GithubScm extends AbstractScm {
      @Override
      public Object getState() {
          checkPermission();
          this.validateExistingAccessToken();
          return super.getState();
      }

      protected void checkPermission() {
          AccessControlled rootOrgFolder = getRootOrgFolder();
          if (!rootOrgFolder.hasPermission(Item.CREATE)) {
              throw new ServiceException.ForbiddenException("You do not have Job/Create permission");
          }
      }
  }
  ```
